il to avoid duplication errors during insertion. Additionally, I\'m defining a set of sample incidents and their respective SLAs and priorities, for a more comprehensive seed.\n\n\n**Defining Incident Data**\n\nI\'m now focusing on sample incidents, SLAs, and priorities. I\'ve added more example incident types such as \"Printer Jam,\" \"IP Phone Down,\" and \"Software Installation.\" I am documenting the network information, including network descriptions, base IPs, and network descriptions.\n\n\n**Defining Network Information**\n\nI\'m now defining the network information, starting with `net1`, `net2`, and `net3`, and their respective subnets including CIDR, gateway, and broadcast information. Then I\'m planning to generate 25-30 equipment, detailing each item\'s ID, type, and name.\n\n\n"
