ponent and will test it to refine its responsive behavior.\n\n\n**Improving Recent Incident Display**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the display for recent incidents, specifically the styling within lines 845-849. I\'m prioritizing improvements to the title\'s visual presentation and adjusting the font size and color for better readability, and incorporating a `line-clamp-1` to the ticket title. My goal is to enhance the presentation of this crucial information.\n\n\n"
